5,1,1,talk,Asuka,,"The current setup is failing. Mornings are chaotic, and bikes get damaged. We need a system that actually works.","{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,1,1,talk,Ryuji,,"I agree the current state is unsustainable. However, before proposing solutions, we must understand the financial implications. What is the actual cost of maintaining a new system?","{""words"":27,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,1,1,talk,George,,I have watched the parking area for years. The same flats seem to keep the best spots. I need to verify if this is fact or just resentment.,"{""words"":28,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,1,1,talk,Shunichi,,"Ryuji, costs are secondary. If this rule makes neighbors hostile, the building rots from the inside. I need to know the social fallout.","{""words"":23,""mentions"":[""Ryuji""],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""name_label"",""name"":""Shunichi"",""self"":true,""raw"":""Shunichi: Ryuji, costs are secondary. If this rule makes neighbors hostile, the building rots from the inside. I need to know the social fallout.""}]}"
9,1,1,talk,Mio,,I’m worried about who actually does the work! The last two jobs just vanished because nobody wanted the hassle. I need to know the real effort involved.,"{""words"":27,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,1,2,talk,Asuka,,"@George, your observation about the same flats holding spots is critical. I need to verify if the physical layout or just habit causes this.","{""words"":24,""mentions"":[""George""],""raw_differs"":false}"
11,1,2,talk,Ryuji,,"@Mio, the effort is real, but the ledger is empty. I need to know if we have funds for any new system.","{""words"":22,""mentions"":[""Mio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,1,2,talk,George,,"@Ryuji, I will check the minutes to see if the current arrangement was ever formally reviewed or just drifted into place.","{""words"":21,""mentions"":[""Ryuji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,1,2,talk,Shunichi,,"@Mio, the social fallout is exactly what I mean. If people start timing their exits to avoid each other, the building rots. I need to know the real cost of that friction.","{""words"":32,""mentions"":[""Mio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,1,2,talk,Mio,,"@Shunichi, I hear you, but I’m scared of the paperwork! I’ll check the treasurer’s file to see how much time the current cash handling actually eats up.","{""words"":27,""mentions"":[""Shunichi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
15,1,3,talk,Asuka,,"@Ryuji, I will check the morning departures to quantify the actual chaos. @Mio, I will also check the rain exposure to see if location dictates damage.","{""words"":26,""mentions"":[""Ryuji"",""Mio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
16,1,3,talk,Ryuji,,"@Asuka, quantifying the chaos is useful, but I need the financial baseline. I will check the building account's two-year ledger and the ward cycle park by the station.","{""words"":28,""mentions"":[""Asuka""],""raw_differs"":false}"
17,1,3,talk,George,,"@Asuka, your morning data will show the friction. I will check the five years of minutes and the sticker register to see who actually rides daily.","{""words"":26,""mentions"":[""Asuka""],""raw_differs"":false}"
18,1,3,talk,Shunichi,,"@Mio, your treasurer check covers the workload. I’ll check the complaint log and the neighbouring block’s account to see how these arrangements actually sour relationships.","{""words"":25,""mentions"":[""Mio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
19,1,3,talk,Mio,,"@Ryuji, checking the ledger is smart! I’ll look into the supplier’s display frame trial to see if the physical effort is manageable for one person.","{""words"":25,""mentions"":[""Ryuji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
20,1,4,talk,Asuka,,I will check the morning departures and the rain exposure. This will show us the physical reality of the current failure.,"{""words"":21,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
21,1,4,talk,Ryuji,,I will check the building account's two-year ledger and the ward cycle park by the station. This establishes the financial baseline and external alternatives.,"{""words"":24,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
