35,2,1,talk,Asuka,,"The data confirms the chaos. Eleven bikes leave between seven and nine, and four required shifting others. Rain exposure also dictates damage.","{""words"":22,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
36,2,1,talk,Ryuji,,"The ledger shows no capital funds, requiring a levy. The station park costs 2,600 yen monthly with a long waitlist. We must price this accurately.","{""words"":25,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
37,2,1,talk,George,,"The minutes confirm my suspicion. The same flats held the covered spots for five years without any review. It was never fair, just inertia.","{""words"":24,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
38,2,1,talk,Shunichi,,Nine complaints died because no one owned them. The block behind us lost two members to a simple fee. We are walking into a trap.,"{""words"":25,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
39,2,1,talk,Mio,,"Wow, three hours a month just for the current mess! Adding per-place billing sounds like a nightmare. Who actually has time for that?","{""words"":23,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
40,2,2,talk,Asuka,,"@Ryuji, the station park is full. We cannot outsource this. @George, five years of inertia proves the current system is broken. We need a structural fix, not just a price tag.","{""words"":31,""mentions"":[""Ryuji"",""George""],""raw_differs"":false}"
41,2,2,talk,Ryuji,,"@Asuka, the station park is full, but the 2,600 yen benchmark is vital. It shows residents value convenience. We must price our solution against that external reality.","{""words"":27,""mentions"":[""Asuka""],""raw_differs"":false}"
42,2,2,talk,George,,"@Ryuji, pricing is secondary to fairness. The minutes prove the current setup is arbitrary. I need a system that actually reflects who uses the space daily.","{""words"":26,""mentions"":[""Ryuji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
43,2,2,talk,Shunichi,,"@George, fairness is abstract. The block behind us shows fees create enemies. If we charge, we lose people. I need a system that doesn’t force confrontation.","{""words"":26,""mentions"":[""George""],""raw_differs"":false}"
44,2,2,talk,Mio,,"@Shunichi, I get the social risk! But @Ryuji, the ledger is empty. If we charge, who handles the extra three hours of paperwork?","{""words"":23,""mentions"":[""Shunichi"",""Ryuji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
45,2,3,talk,Asuka,,"@Mio, the rain data proves location dictates damage. We need a system that accounts for this physical reality, not just abstract fairness.","{""words"":22,""mentions"":[""Mio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
46,2,3,talk,Ryuji,,"@Mio, the ledger confirms zero capital funds. Any new system requires a levy. @Shunichi, the 2,600 yen benchmark proves residents value convenience. We must price accordingly.","{""words"":26,""mentions"":[""Mio"",""Shunichi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
47,2,3,talk,George,,"@Shunichi, the sticker register shows daily riders prefer paying over equal claims. @Mio, the minutes prove the current setup is arbitrary. We need a fair, sustainable method.","{""words"":27,""mentions"":[""Shunichi"",""Mio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
48,2,3,talk,Shunichi,,"@George, that register data is dangerous. If daily riders pay, casual users resent it. The block behind us proves fees isolate people. We need a system that doesn’t create a two-tier building.","{""words"":32,""mentions"":[""George""],""raw_differs"":false}"
